Package: methylVCF
Title: Query DNA Methylation in VCF and gVCF Files
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person("Francesc", "Català-Moll", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "fcatala@irsicaixa.es", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2354-8648"))
Description: Queries DNA methylation by genomic region in Illumina DRAGEN
    5-Base VCF and gVCF files and in Rastair VCF files. Returns genomic
    ranges with the reported methylation fraction, informative read depth,
    and allele or haplotype assignment when supported by the input.
    Preserves source record coordinates and distinguishes zero informative
    depth from an observed zero methylation fraction. Aligns reference
    methylation measurements across samples in a ranged experiment.
